  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, throw this bomb at a point up to 40 feet away. One round after it lands, it emits poisonous smoke (heavily obscured, 20-foot radius). A creature that starts its turn in the smoke must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or be @condition[poisoned] for 1 hour. Wind disperses as Smoke Bomb. A poisoned creature can repeat its saving throw at the end of its turn, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p><p>Foundry: Throw places the cloud template; Use Gas runs the Con save against creatures in the area (proxy for starting a turn in the smoke).</p><p><em>Craft (Combo List): Tinker's Tools — Bomb Casing + Toadstool DC 15, qty 1.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Poison Smoke Bomb</strong></p>"
    },
